serversTitle=1ST DIGITAL SERVERS&serversText=THE WEAPONS OF WAR MAY CHANGE. THE BATTLEGROUNDS MAY MOVE TO NEW LOCATIONS. SOLDIERS WILL STILL RECEIVE GLORY… OR DEATH. WE ARE VETERIANS.. WE’VE BEEN THROUGH THE GRINDER. WE’VE SEEN COUNTLESS BATTLES AND AN UNFATHOMABLE NUMBER OF DEATHS. WE KNOW WAR CHANGES. WE CHANGE WITH IT.<br><br>OVER THE COURSE OF TIME, THE 1ST DIGITAL INFANTRY HAS HAD MANY SERVERS AND WILL HAVE MANY MORE. OUR CURRENT SERVERS ARE LISTED HERE. CLICK THE TABS BELOW TO SEE EACH INDIVIDUAL  SERVER’S DETAILS.<br><br>JOIN US ONLINE. DIE WELL.&server1=TEAMSPEAK SERVER&serverName1=TEAMSPEAK SERVER&serverIP1=70.84.170.226:8811&serverImage1=teamspeakserverimage.jpg&serverText1=It's our Voice-Over-IP server. So we can make fun of you. <br><br>Gonna be online?<br>Join our TeamSpeak server.<br><br>Make sure you select a name. Guest gets kicked... <a href='http://www.goteamspeak.com/'><u>Click Here</u></a> to get the TeamSpeak Client.&server2=BATTLEFIELD 2 SERVER&serverName2=1ST DIGITAL BATTLEGROUNDS&serverIP2=208.51.201.233:16567&serverImage2=battlegroundsimage.jpg&serverText2=The Battlegrounds is our ranked 32 person BF2 server. We're actually going to change it into a private locked match server. There are plenty of other ranked servers we can play on...&totalServers=2